# Jaden Somkhathy — Portfolio

Personal portfolio website for Jaden Somkhathy (Sboniso Vilakazi), a
software developer based in Durban, South Africa.

Live site: https://jaden-somkhathy.github.io/portfolio/

## Structure

- `index.html` / `style.css` — home page
- `gallery.html` / `gallery.css` / `gallery.js` — featured work, with
  a certificates folder viewer
- `project-*.html` — individual project detail pages
- `script.js` — shared site behavior (nav, scroll reveal, animated
  background)
- `certificates/` — certificate PDFs shown in the Achievements folder

